        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No extra ordinary or sparing circumstance has even otherwise been made out for the purpose of extending benefit of bail to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "70166622397d4e67aa243e06cae93ac8_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7. The petitioner is alleged to be involved in the business of preparation of fake desi ghee and is further alleged to have been selling such ghee by using the brand name of Nestle Everyday Ghee and by displaying a fake name/brand of the gh"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c4343083c1ea4cf6a1e5b4bea80c3f55_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Allegations against him are quite serious in nature."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d0d53bb16cf4a10b70e3c6c2a2cd60b_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The FIR initially registered under the provisions of Indian Penal 4 of 6 Neutral Citation No:=2024:PHHC:155504 Code and now offences under the provisions of BNS, 2023 had been added which are prima facie attracted in this case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8d14eb6ba5e7443eb65cc6d6c069088b_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner is a habitual offender as two more cases bearing FIR No. 143 dated 28.10.2023 and FIR No. 65 dated 10.06.2017 both under the similar provisions have been registered against him at Police Station Tapa, District Barnala."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4bad7a5689394fbab3262a85d9c04103_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "To elicit the truth as to the manner in which the petitioner had cheated the general public and for conducting thorough investigation in the matter, the custodial interrogation of the petitioner is must."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ce7e951a797d4d76aa6b734cf9229acd_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is well settled proposition of law that while deciding an application for grant of anticipatory bail, the nature and gravity of the accusation, the part played by the accused, the possibility of his fleeing from justice or likelihood to "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0073dec4b9ba4ebb82cde911694fc897_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The allegations against the petitioner are specific and serious in nature."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b56f003b62af4f17b570b4ec2ef412ba_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is well settled that custodial interrogation of a suspected person is qualitatively more elicitation oriented than questioning a suspect who is well ensconced with a favourable order under Section 438 of Cr.P.C."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9f94b965d81e4acbb51ad0cbf3f95511_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Many useful information can be disinterred during custodial interrogation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "509ad491b31c4d6397988b8508c04eb9_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Moreso, no exception or extra ordinary circumstance warranting exercise of powers for grant of pre-arrest bail is made out in this case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ecdba733e0c147149f9079a11bfa09f5_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Keeping in view the nature of the subject offences and the role attributed to the petitioner and for the purpose of eliciting the truth, I am of the considered opinion that he does not deserve to be extended benefit of pre-arrest bail."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "28ebf2190cfb49c581ae7ce5b28400d6_59",
